n-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Capps</surname><given-names>NE</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Risks and benefits of omega 3 fats for mortality, cardiovascular disease, and cancer: systematic review</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2006</year><volume>332</volume><fpage>752</fpage><lpage>760</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16565093</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Buettner</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Parhofer</surname><given-names>KG</given-names></name><name><surname>Woenckhaus</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wrede</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kunz-Schughart</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Scholmerich</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bollheimer</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Defining high-fat-diet rat models: metabolic and molecular effects of different fat types</article-title><source>J Mol Endocrinol</source><year>2006</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>485</fpage><lpage>501</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16720718</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Jump</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Polyunsaturated fatty acids regulate lipogenic and peroxisomal gene expression by independent mechanisms</article-title><source>Prostaglandins Leukot Essent Fatty Acids</source><year>1997</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>65</fpage><lpage>69</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9250610</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Flachs</surname><given-names>P</given-names></nam